This directory is the default output location used by the examples in README.md,
usage.md, USECASE.md and contributing.md (e.g. --report reports/scan.txt).

FlatScan does not create parent directories, so those examples fail on a fresh
clone if this directory is missing. It is kept in the repository for that reason.

Two things here are tracked on purpose and documented in reports/README.md: that
guide itself, and the single published reference report pack in vidar.exe.pack/,
which exists so the output formats can be inspected without building the tool.

Everything else is ignored by .gitignore. Never commit your own scan output,
analysed samples, or anything derived from them.
